DUSD::setFlashFeeReceiver
├── given caller is not owner
│   └── it should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
└── given caller is owner
    ├── when setting flash fee receiver to zero address
    │   ├── it should set flashFeeReceiver to zero address
    │   └── it should emit SetFlashFeeReceiver event with old and new receiver
    ├── when setting flash fee receiver to valid address
    │   ├── it should set flashFeeReceiver to the new address
    │   └── it should emit SetFlashFeeReceiver event with old and new receiver
    └── when setting flash fee receiver to same address
        ├── it should update flashFeeReceiver to the same address
        └── it should emit SetFlashFeeReceiver event with old and new receiver